sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant TUI as docket TUI
    participant D as daemon
    participant DB as SQLite
    User->>TUI: presses n
    TUI->>+D: ClientRequest::CreateAgent
    D->>DB: INSERT agents
    DB-->>D: row id
    D-)TUI: AgentCreated
    D-->>-TUI: Ack
    Note over TUI,D: the ack carries the req_id
